Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-epgtoxml
Version: @VERSION@
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Arcardy
Depends: enigma2, python-core, python-json, python-xml
Recommends: enigma2-plugin-extensions-epgimport
Description: Task-based Sky.de EPGImport helper for Enigma2
 EpgToXml fetches Sky.de EPG data, writes EPGImport-compatible files,
 and can trigger EPGImport on Dreambox/Newnigma2 OE2.5 receivers.
